{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to \u200b<strong>Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9</strong>, hidden at the corner of the street! This is the central stage for the lives of all the animal residents in this small alley. Every single day, the animals living here perform their unique and busy \u201csymphony of beats.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/extras/15e587fe1ac43d147f47f89054991ae6.avif?t=1756968783\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the demo version of &quot;<strong>Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9</strong>&quot;! This demo features two playable characters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Mr. Dog\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/extras/7551603ea47939dbc6e03532627dbceb.avif?t=1756968783\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A white-collar worker in Animal Town, diligent and dedicated. All of Mr. Dog\u2019s levels are workplace-themed. From the boss\u2019s promises to colleagues\u2019 gossip, his own distractions, and the leader\u2019s blame\u2014the daily life of an office worker is sure to resonate with you. This demo includes 3 short levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Panda Master\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/extras/ae219a4f4e8169081f2b48b1f6bc79f5.avif?t=1756968783\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, he helps neighbors repair plumbing and electrical issues; by night, he runs a street food stall Fried Rice. A multi-talented side hustler and your friendly neighbor, Panda Master. Though an ordinary citizen, he carries big dreams in his heart. This demo includes 1 short level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future Content: The full version will feature 5 characters with a total of 35 levels. Each character will have their own profession and story. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979510?t=1756968783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/348ef4f4633168149e7ac58f2e46f4fc88858f8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756968783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/6db655b25c0f05ae8e21b84c96a12a91a94459ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756968783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/6db655b25c0f05ae8e21b84c96a12a91a94459ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756968783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to \u200b<strong>Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9</strong>, hidden at the corner of the street! This is the central stage for the lives of all the animal residents in this small alley. Every single day, the animals living here perform their unique and busy \u201csymphony of beats.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/extras/15e587fe1ac43d147f47f89054991ae6.avif?t=1756968783\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the demo version of &quot;<strong>Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9</strong>&quot;! This demo features two playable characters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Mr. Dog\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/extras/7551603ea47939dbc6e03532627dbceb.avif?t=1756968783\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A white-collar worker in Animal Town, diligent and dedicated. All of Mr. Dog\u2019s levels are workplace-themed. From the boss\u2019s promises to colleagues\u2019 gossip, his own distractions, and the leader\u2019s blame\u2014the daily life of an office worker is sure to resonate with you. This demo includes 3 short levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Panda Master\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/extras/ae219a4f4e8169081f2b48b1f6bc79f5.avif?t=1756968783\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, he helps neighbors repair plumbing and electrical issues; by night, he runs a street food stall Fried Rice. A multi-talented side hustler and your friendly neighbor, Panda Master. Though an ordinary citizen, he carries big dreams in his heart. This demo includes 1 short level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future Content: The full version will feature 5 characters with a total of 35 levels. Each character will have their own profession and story. </p>","developers":["Salt Game Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3859210","name":"Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979510/bd6a1e6e2623c628b92d0f2c012328ea04dec293/header.jpg?t=1756968783","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257190778,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190778/movie480.mp4?t=1756968774","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190778/movie_max.m